message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "From Gradient to Transformer to Circuit"
abstract: >-
  Training small decoder-only transformers and reverse-engineering what they
  learn: superposition geometry, prefix-copying heads, grokking on modular
  addition, activation/path patching and sparse autoencoders, plus a
  pre-registered test of the same instruments on GPT-2 small, with every public
  number traced to a committed run manifest.
